Mnemox Control licensing
========================

The Python evaluation engine under `src/` and its engine tests are licensed
under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 only (AGPL-3.0-only). The
complete license text is in `LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt`.

Protocol specifications, JSON schemas, and conformance vectors under
`docs/protocol/` and `tests/conformance/` are licensed under the Apache
License 2.0. The complete license text is in `LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`.

Commercial use of the engine under alternative terms requires a separate
written agreement. See `COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md`.

The Mnemox name, logos, and trademarks are not licensed by the source-code or
protocol licenses except as necessary to identify the origin of the work.
